    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maid of Venia</strong> is an action RPG adventure where you step into the armor of a red-haired warrior sworn to the Belt\u2019s service, tasked with protecting the land of Venia from encroaching threats. But as you fulfill your sacred duties, you\u2019ll uncover unsettling truths about your mission. Are you truly serving justice, or is there a hidden hand guiding your fate?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of your journey, you must decide your combat style. Will you embrace the destructive power of fire as a <strong>Fire Mage</strong>, raining down flames upon your foes? Or will you take the path of the <strong>Summoner</strong>, calling forth spectral allies to fight by your side? Each choice alters your abilities, shaping the way you approach combat and the challenges ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Steeped in Mystery and Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a beautifully crafted world teeming with both wonder and danger:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thistledown</strong>, a hidden Elven town nestled in the towering silverwood trees, is home to ancient scholars, artisans, and rangers who protect their sacred lands from outsiders. It is a place of both wisdom and caution\u2014where you may find powerful enchantments or wary allies unwilling to meddle in human conflicts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Havenbay</strong>, a bustling coastal city, serves as a gateway to adventure. Here, you can catch a boat to perilous islands overrun by pirates and goblins, uncovering lost relics and forgotten ruins amidst the treacherous waves. But beware\u2014some ships that sail from Havenbay never return.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six grand kingdoms or towns to explore with unique quests and characters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Queen\u2019s Deception &amp; The Witch\u2019s Influence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you battle goblins, dragons, and the formidable <strong>Witch of the Wasteland</strong>, an even darker plot begins to unravel. The Queen herself may be behind a sinister scheme, conspiring with the Witch to manipulate your destiny. Through powerful magic, the Witch casts a spell that convinces you that your god is speaking directly to you\u2014guiding your path, commanding your battles, and whispering of divine purpose. But is it truly your god\u2019s voice? Or are you merely a pawn in the Queen\u2019s war?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat and Growth</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up and customize your character</strong>, unlocking new skills, spells, and combat techniques.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield powerful weapons</strong> unique to your chosen class, from flaming swords to spectral staves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face epic enemies</strong>, including cunning goblin warlords, fire-breathing dragons, and the deceptive Witch of the Wasteland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a historically inspired fantasy world</strong>, drawing inspiration from the legend of Joan of Arc, known as the <i>Maid of Orleans</i>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey in <strong>Maid of Venia</strong> is more than just a battle for survival\u2014it\u2019s a quest for truth, where faith, fate, and deception intertwine. Will you uncover the Queen\u2019s hidden agenda before it\u2019s too late? Or will you march blindly into a war shaped by lies? The choice is yours.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maid of Venia</strong> is an action RPG adventure where you step into the armor of a red-haired warrior sworn to the Belt\u2019s service, tasked with protecting the land of Venia from encroaching threats. But as you fulfill your sacred duties, you\u2019ll uncover unsettling truths about your mission. Are you truly serving justice, or is there a hidden hand guiding your fate?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of your journey, you must decide your combat style. Will you embrace the destructive power of fire as a <strong>Fire Mage</strong>, raining down flames upon your foes? Or will you take the path of the <strong>Summoner</strong>, calling forth spectral allies to fight by your side? Each choice alters your abilities, shaping the way you approach combat and the challenges ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Steeped in Mystery and Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a beautifully crafted world teeming with both wonder and danger:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thistledown</strong>, a hidden Elven town nestled in the towering silverwood trees, is home to ancient scholars, artisans, and rangers who protect their sacred lands from outsiders. It is a place of both wisdom and caution\u2014where you may find powerful enchantments or wary allies unwilling to meddle in human conflicts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Havenbay</strong>, a bustling coastal city, serves as a gateway to adventure. Here, you can catch a boat to perilous islands overrun by pirates and goblins, uncovering lost relics and forgotten ruins amidst the treacherous waves. But beware\u2014some ships that sail from Havenbay never return.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six grand kingdoms or towns to explore with unique quests and characters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Queen\u2019s Deception &amp; The Witch\u2019s Influence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you battle goblins, dragons, and the formidable <strong>Witch of the Wasteland</strong>, an even darker plot begins to unravel. The Queen herself may be behind a sinister scheme, conspiring with the Witch to manipulate your destiny. Through powerful magic, the Witch casts a spell that convinces you that your god is speaking directly to you\u2014guiding your path, commanding your battles, and whispering of divine purpose. But is it truly your god\u2019s voice? Or are you merely a pawn in the Queen\u2019s war?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat and Growth</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up and customize your character</strong>, unlocking new skills, spells, and combat techniques.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield powerful weapons</strong> unique to your chosen class, from flaming swords to spectral staves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face epic enemies</strong>, including cunning goblin warlords, fire-breathing dragons, and the deceptive Witch of the Wasteland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a historically inspired fantasy world</strong>, drawing inspiration from the legend of Joan of Arc, known as the <i>Maid of Orleans</i>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey in <strong>Maid of Venia</strong> is more than just a battle for survival\u2014it\u2019s a quest for truth, where faith, fate, and deception intertwine. Will you uncover the Queen\u2019s hidden agenda before it\u2019s too late? Or will you march blindly into a war shaped by lies? The choice is yours.</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on an action RPG adventure as the Maid of Venia, tasked with defending your homeland and uncovering the truth about the enigmatic Belt. Level up, wield powerful weapons, and unlock new abilities as you battle goblins, and the formidable Witch of the Wasteland.",
